WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/driving/components/ShareDriveDialog.tsx — a Modal(open,onClose,title="Share Drive") with three
  hooks (useShareLinks list query, useCreateShareLink mutation, useRevokeShareLink mutation) + useTranslation.
  Regions:
    Modal(title "Share Drive")
      → IF !shareUrl : create form — description copy; optional-title Input; "Include speed data" Toggle;
        "Include detailed telemetry (battery, power)" Toggle; "Link expires after" Select (7d/30d/90d/Never,
        where Never posts expires_in_days=undefined via Number('0')||undefined); full-width "Generate Link"
        Button (loading = createShare.isPending) → on success setShareUrl(`${origin}/s/${token}`).
      → ELSE : result — green "Share link created!"; read-only URL Input; CopyButton ("Copy Link") + ExternalLink
        (window.open); ghost "Create another link" → setShareUrl(null).
      → IF shares.length>0 : "Active Share Links" list — per share a GlassPanel: title (or "Untitled share"),
        Eye+{views} views, expiry caption (isExpired?"Expired":expires_at?"Expires {date}":"No expiry"),
        iconOnly CopyButton ("Copy link") + Trash revoke ("Revoke", red).
      → IF sharesLoading : a Spinner.
  Helpers consumed: formatDate (dateFormat.ts — numeric-year/short-month/numeric-day, "—" for nil/invalid) and the
  inline `${window.location.origin}/s/${token}` URL builder.

